  "benefits_features_and_faqs": {
    "about_overview": "BPCL SBI Card Octane is a **co-branded fuel credit card** and an upgraded version of the BPCL SBI Card. It offers **up to 7.25% value-back** on fuel spends at BPCL and remained the best fuel credit cards in India—until the launch of the **Indian Oil RBL XTRA Credit Card** , which provides an **8.5% value-back** on Indian Oil fuel spends. Designed for commuters who spend a significant amount on fuel, the **BPCL** **Octane Card** offers **25X reward points** (25 points per ₹100) on BPCL fuel purchases, along with a **fuel surcharge waiver of up to ₹100 per month**. Beyond fuel, it provides **10X reward points** on groceries, departmental stores, movie tickets, and dining—covering key everyday spending categories. Reward points can be redeemed for fuel at BPCL outlets at a rate of **1 RP = Rs. 0.25**. While BPCL SBI Card Octane is an excellent choice for BPCL loyalists, its **base reward rate of just 0.25%** on other spends may not appeal to users seeking broader benefits.",
